    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/062b56f88769d91403e585c6165eca59.poster.avif?t=1754595402\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/062b56f88769d91403e585c6165eca59.webm?t=1754595402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/062b56f88769d91403e585c6165eca59.mp4?t=1754595402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Arab man has one request: make the ultimate Dubai chocolate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]In Dubai Chocolate Simulator, you take on a series of bizarre yet hilarious challenges to collect the ingredients for a one-of-a-kind chocolate. From boxing rings to racetracks, every mission brings you closer to crafting the legendary treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]You\u2019ll earn gold by boxing, win pistachio cream through horse racing, conquer obstacle courses to get cocoa, defeat enemies on a farm to collect pistachios Once all ingredients are gathered, it\u2019s time to combine them and deliver your handcrafted Dubai chocolate to the man who started it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]This game blends humor, action, and simple mechanics into a fun and fast-paced simulation experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/8117f3f86ca00ed1778b3b85bed28d4b.poster.avif?t=1754595402\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/8117f3f86ca00ed1778b3b85bed28d4b.webm?t=1754595402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/8117f3f86ca00ed1778b3b85bed28d4b.mp4?t=1754595402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]Complete five wild missions, each with a unique gameplay style</p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]Collect real ingredients like cocoa, pistachio cream, tahini, and more</p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]Switch between fighting, racing, platforming, and driving</p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]Craft your own Dubai chocolate in the final step</p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]A short, quirky, and satisfying journey with a flavorful twist</p></strong></li></ul><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]Do you have what it takes to fulfill the mission and satisfy the chocolate master?</p></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/062b56f88769d91403e585c6165eca59.poster.avif?t=1754595402\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/062b56f88769d91403e585c6165eca59.webm?t=1754595402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/062b56f88769d91403e585c6165eca59.mp4?t=1754595402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Arab man has one request: make the ultimate Dubai chocolate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]In Dubai Chocolate Simulator, you take on a series of bizarre yet hilarious challenges to collect the ingredients for a one-of-a-kind chocolate. From boxing rings to racetracks, every mission brings you closer to crafting the legendary treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]You\u2019ll earn gold by boxing, win pistachio cream through horse racing, conquer obstacle courses to get cocoa, defeat enemies on a farm to collect pistachios Once all ingredients are gathered, it\u2019s time to combine them and deliver your handcrafted Dubai chocolate to the man who started it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]This game blends humor, action, and simple mechanics into a fun and fast-paced simulation experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/8117f3f86ca00ed1778b3b85bed28d4b.poster.avif?t=1754595402\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/8117f3f86ca00ed1778b3b85bed28d4b.webm?t=1754595402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/8117f3f86ca00ed1778b3b85bed28d4b.mp4?t=1754595402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]Complete five wild missions, each with a unique gameplay style</p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]Collect real ingredients like cocoa, pistachio cream, tahini, and more</p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]Switch between fighting, racing, platforming, and driving</p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]Craft your own Dubai chocolate in the final step</p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]A short, quirky, and satisfying journey with a flavorful twist</p></strong></li></ul><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]Do you have what it takes to fulfill the mission and satisfy the chocolate master?</p></strong></p>",
